INSERT INTO content_embeddings (content_id, chunk_index, chunk_text, embedding, chunk_hash, status)
SELECT c.id, 0, 'In Flutter, `setState`와 같은 방법으로 위젯 수준에서 상태를 관리하는 것 외에도, 애플리케이션 전체 또는 특정 영역의 데이터 공유 및 상태 관리를 위해 다양한 메커니즘이 있습니다. 이 콘텐츠에서는 `InheritedWidget`과 Riverpod라는 도구를 사용하여 상태를 효율적으로 관리하는 방법을 살펴보겠습니다.

### InheritedWidget 사용법
InheritedWidget은 위젯 트리에서 데이터를 공유하기 위한 클래스입니다. 자식 위젯들이 부모의 데이터에 접근할 수 있도록 합니다.
```dart
class ThemeProvider extends InheritedWidget {
  final ThemeData theme;

  ThemeProvider({required this.theme, required Widget child}) : super(child: child);

  static ThemeData of(BuildContext context) =>
      (context.dependOnInheritedWidgetOfExactType<ThemeProvider>() ?? ThemeProvider(theme: ThemeData(), child: Container())).theme;
}
```
위 예제에서 `ThemeProvider`는 `ThemeData`를 전달하며, `of` 메서드를 통해 위젯 트리의 하위 요소가 이 값을 접근할 수 있습니다.

### Riverpod 사용법
Riverpod는 상태 관리를 위한 더 모던하고 강력한 도구입니다. Provider 패키지를 설치 후, 상태 클래스를 생성하여 `Provider`나 `StateNotifierProvider`로 감싸서 사용합니다.
```dart
final counterProvider = StateNotifierProvider<CounterModel>((ref) => CounterModel());
class CounterModel extends StateNotifier<int> {
  CounterModel() : super(0);

  void increment() {
    state++;
  }
}
```
`counterProvider`는 `StateNotifierProvider`를 사용하여 상태 변경을 추적하고, 이 값을 필요로 하는 위젯에서 읽을 수 있습니다.', '[-0.422094,1.575075,-3.653641,-1.373008,0.539778,-0.317455,0.928879,0.184966,-0.030963,-1.301547,-0.861408,0.786783,1.606894,1.347705,-0.892697,0.133951,-0.347690,-0.188394,-0.166580,0.139120,1.046701,-0.802837,-0.375320,-0.405458,1.344837,0.843025,0.246170,-0.038860,-1.621061,0.626474,0.643552,-0.176492,-0.060373,-0.628834,-0.344822,0.230857,0.415909,0.007348,-0.818923,0.630421,0.107193,0.046681,-0.175684,-0.059163,0.258102,0.586490,1.811007,0.803342,0.288977,-0.924612,0.165142,-0.031553,0.185877,-1.407219,1.086929,1.447057,0.137440,0.736049,0.402399,-0.235485,-0.243136,1.593578,-1.077489,0.921513,-0.010848,-0.276741,-0.507999,-0.119607,0.059740,-0.195185,1.096348,0.155028,-0.166751,-0.397100,-0.216035,-0.214969,-1.352578,-0.269884,-0.254263,0.960856,1.063501,-0.313730,0.786822,0.464190,1.511124,0.608506,-0.234214,-0.760821,-0.985943,0.575803,0.831978,-0.454494,-0.081668,0.130256,-1.418870,-0.061308,-0.229175,0.421512,-0.309025,-0.695208,0.135363,-0.241033,-0.126212,-0.314471,-0.301415,0.452671,-0.271641,0.497917,0.207275,-0.721412,0.142189,0.069771,-0.540281,0.065484,-0.202713,-0.038171,0.849771,0.198565,-0.742260,-0.550680,0.393669,-0.757711,0.329191,1.490287,1.547568,0.362968,-0.236619,0.457100,-0.624132,-1.271105,0.403404,-0.564363,-1.045709,-0.511178,0.269594,0.595372,0.111653,0.425365,0.477857,-0.097100,-0.287250,0.764354,-0.037036,-1.253816,0.094378,-0.202956,0.719044,-0.408825,-1.625890,-0.222960,-0.354233,0.644544,-0.992001,-0.295146,0.671181,-0.804571,0.789955,-0.086755,-0.289631,0.795809,1.340629,0.518122,0.159521,0.584110,-0.954929,-0.785520,0.589587,0.978179,-0.000462,0.711204,-1.073943,0.028450,0.316747,0.433971,0.712208,0.413190,0.508918,-0.856728,0.214555,-1.355796,-0.423901,-0.699250,0.675979,0.752569,-0.751811,0.467884,-0.511945,-1.175754,-0.631777,-1.057177,0.405494,-0.494870,-0.994007,0.464950,-0.910779,-1.068761,0.844597,-0.458981,0.287779,-0.084701,0.3